#: ../../source/docs/modules/DGPS.rst:3 e3082f3774cc403581f00c895f223138
msgid "Differential GPS"
msgstr "差分 GPS"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/DGPS.rst:9 15bdf7c83ba44f6f99f78524261b4157
msgid ""
"Provides a method to supply DGPS data up to the UAV, in order to provide "
"greater positional accuracy. The ground station segment of the DGPS system "
"is required to be networked with the ground station running MAVProxy."
msgstr "提供一种向无人机上传 DGPS 数据的方法，以实现更高的定位精度。DGPS 系统的地面站部分需要与运行 MAVProxy 的地面站联网。"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/DGPS.rst:14 c7cb21c4df4442a0841691b7c39b1b68
msgid ""
"It is assumed that the DGPS data comes from the network address "
"127.0.0.1:13320."
msgstr "假设 DGPS 数据来自网络地址 127.0.0.1:13320。"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/DGPS.rst:16 3f558d709455495bb6e0440ae8ffba7e
msgid "The DGPS data can be in the SBP/RTCP/UBC protocols"
msgstr "DGPS 数据可采用 SBP/RTCP/UBC 协议格式。"
